      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "Hi everyone. Thanks for your comments around this issue.\n\nWe'd like to clarify that this behavior is a bug, and was not intentional. Issues surrounding avatar gestures being culled on remote users at a distance are believed to have been addressed in our most recent patch release, 2025.1.1p1 (build 1568). If you are still encountering issues in this latest version, please create a new post in the Bug Reports section of Canny including the ID of at least one avatar suffering from the issue as well as steps that we can follow to reproduce the problem you're seeing.\n\nAt this time, we do not believe the issue referenced here is related to animator culling, because this only comes into effect when you explicitly hide avatars by distance or by count.",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    },
