      "statusChangeID": "67a9f5ae959a104c2e6487c2",
      "statusChangeNewStatus": "closed",
      "value": "Since there has been no further activity on this post and there appear to be no recent bug reports related to the underlying issue this post describes, we'll close this feature request for now as we have no plans to make animator culling on distance hidden avatars optional at this time.\n\nAs always, please feel free to open a bug report including both an avatar ID and reproduction steps if you think you've discovered a regression in one of your avatars.",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    }
